{%- comment -%}
  EVERSTORY — the three things that happen, in order, right under the buy box.

  The flow (you choose, you upload, we make it) is currently spread across the
  buy box, the accordions and the long page. A shopper deciding right now should
  not have to assemble it. Numbered markers are used because this genuinely is a
  sequence, not decoration.

  Step 1 differs by product: the Name & Photo Sticker Sheet fixes the sizes and
  adds the name; the Custom Sticker Sheet does not. Everything else is identical,
  so it is one snippet with one branch rather than two blocks in the template.

  Styles are scoped to .es-hto and take their colour from the surrounding text,
  so this follows the theme's light/dark scheme without its own palette.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign es_hto_pack = product.metafields.custom.pack_sizes.value -%}

<style>
  .es-hto {
    margin-top: 20px;
    padding-top: 18px;
    border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 14%, transparent);
    display: grid;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .es-hto-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; gap: 10px; align-items: baseline; }
  .es-hto-num {
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    opacity: 0.45;
    padding-top: 2px;
  }
  .es-hto-row p { margin: 0; font-size: max(0.875rem, 13.5px); line-height: 1.6; }
  .es-hto-row strong { font-weight: 600; }
  .es-hto-row span { opacity: 0.72; }
</style>

<div class="es-hto">
  <div class="es-hto-row">
    <span class="es-hto-num">01</span>
    <p>
      <strong>Choose.</strong>
      {% if es_hto_pack != blank %}
        <span>Send five photos and the name. The sizes are mixed for you — {{ es_hto_pack }}; you pick the material and the lettering style.</span>
      {% else %}
        <span>Pick your size, your material, how many photos, and how we crop them.</span>
      {% endif %}
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="es-hto-row">
    <span class="es-hto-num">02</span>
    <p>
      <strong>Upload.</strong>
      <span>Send them in one go, plus a spare or two and a note if something matters. If one can't be cut cleanly we use a spare instead of holding up your order.</span>
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="es-hto-row">
    <span class="es-hto-num">03</span>
    <p>
      <strong>We make it.</strong>
      <span>Traced, sized, laid out, cut and packed by hand in Toronto. Ships in 2–5 business days, free across Canada.</span>
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
